        "message": "Add AI-history knowledge base (Turing, Shannon, Pitts, Hebb, Rosenblatt, IIT/GNWT) with authors\n\n- algos/knowledge_ai_history.py: reference cards 'рост понимания: нейрочеловек\n  и ИИ' — Turing (machine/test), Shannon (information/entropy), McCulloch-Pitts\n  (neuron 1943), Hebb (rule), Rosenblatt (perceptron), Minsky/Papert,\n  backprop (Werbos/Rumelhart/Hinton), Wiener (cybernetics), Anokhin, Bosova,\n  IIT (Tononi phi), GNWT (Baars/Dehaene), Poincare (3 bodies), each with\n  author attribution in comments. Light dict module, self-checked.\n- core/mirro_core.py: wire try_ai_history() into _try_direct_handlers so\n  questions like 'кто создал тест тьюринга', 'что такое иит/гнв' answer from\n  this layer.\n\nbuild --check ALL CHECKS PASSED.",
